I²C LCD Backpack PCB

A compact I²C LCD Backpack PCB designed to interface a 16×2 LCD with a microcontroller using the I²C protocol.

Features

- PCF8574 I²C I/O Expander
- 16×2 LCD interface
- Contrast adjustment
- Backlight control
- Compact PCB design
- Designed using KiCad

Tools

- KiCad
- PCB Design & Layout
- Schematic Capture
- ERC/DRC Verification

Applications

Arduino, Raspberry Pi, embedded systems, and IoT projects.

 
